{"id":15217653337,"name":"[V2.17] Ghost at the Door","desc":"🎉Update 2.17🎉\n🔖Added more level tag styles.\n🎮Added a \"play again\" feature.\n❤️Optimized interaction for fear value, pets, and prop systems.\n🔧Fixed several known bugs.\n\nCan you survive if a ghost is crazily trying to break into your house at midnight?\nIt's important to choose a room with essential equipment before the ghost shows up to help you survive, such as lavender, a safe, and a toolbox.\nRemember, the key to winning is to upgrade your door as soon as possible or to kill the ghost before it becomes strong enough to demolish your door.\nUpgrade door and artillery needs sufficient resources, whice requires a strategy to obtain and then balance them.\n\nIf you find the game difficult to play, you can try learning from other players.\n\nIf you enjoy this game, please give us a like👍\n🔔Favorite our game to get more updates!🔔","path":"/game/15217653337-ghost-at-the-door","slug":"15217653337-ghost-at-the-door","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0287b3cd5be86e0261fec1f320ff894afabe1f4c729764e3795de036865d12bc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-afdad5dad07a584087382fb26cf5b02c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":27,"visitor":83508044,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-17T15:32:34.693Z","creator":{"name":"Narcissuss","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"V2.17-Ghost-at-the-Door-Use-all-abilitys-without-paying-use-in-game-29493","_id":"67b35692446bb296ce684531","title":"Use all abilitys without paying use in game","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c789ea","gameId":15217653337,"name":"[V2.17] Ghost at the Door","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":15217653337},"features":"use all in-game abilitys without paying a dime. (Use this in-game btw)","tags":["ghost at the do